      "message": "Looking at the cases that can set cci_event.error, I think there are 3 categories.\n\n1. Ping status remains busy/deferred for longer than 2 seconds.\n2. I2C transactions keep failing, exceeding the retry count limit\n3. Ping status reports an error (cmd_sts \u003d\u003d 3)\n\nI think it only makes sense to read/display the error status from GET_ERROR_STATUS cmd in case #3.",
